outputs.L1:
A method and apparatus for managing communications of a moving platform comprising a plurality of platform applications, a communications system configured to transmit data received from at least one platform application and to provide wireless data communication via one of a plurality of supported communication links, and a data management module. The apparatus and method are configured to:

- receive performance data indicative of the currently available bandwidth of the or each communication link allocated to or associated with the platform applications;
- identify, for each platform application, data to be transmitted to a recipient node and compare the bandwidth requirement of that data with the currently available bandwidth of the respective communication link allocated to or associated with the platform application;
- when the comparison determines that the currently available bandwidth of a communication link is insufficient in relation to the bandwidth requirement of a specified platform application, generate information data and transmit the information data to the specified platform application or to a quality-of-service interface associated therewith; and
- upon receipt of the information data, cause the specified platform application, or the quality-of-service interface associated therewith, to adapt at least one parameter of the respective application data to the currently available bandwidth of the respective communication link for transmission to a recipient node.

outputs.L2:
A method and apparatus are provided for controlling communications on a mobile platform. The platform includes multiple applications, a communication system capable of transmitting data received from at least one of those applications through any one of several supported wireless communication links, and a data-management module. The method and apparatus are configured to:

- obtain performance information representing the bandwidth currently available on each communication link assigned to, or associated with, the platform applications;
- determine, for each application, the data awaiting transmission to a recipient node and compare that data’s bandwidth requirement with the bandwidth presently available on the corresponding assigned or associated communication link;
- when the comparison indicates that a communication link lacks sufficient available bandwidth for a particular application’s requirements, create notification data and send it either to that application or to its associated quality-of-service interface; and
- upon receiving the notification data, cause the particular application or its quality-of-service interface to modify at least one parameter of the relevant application data according to the bandwidth currently available on the corresponding communication link before transmitting the data to the recipient node.

counterfactuals.output:
1. **A communication apparatus for a mobile platform comprising an aircraft, a vessel, or a vehicle, the communication apparatus comprising:**  

   a plurality of wireless communication interfaces configured to communicate over respective wireless links; and  

   one or more processors configured to:  

   execute a plurality of platform applications that generate application data for wireless communication;  

   allocate at least one of the wireless links to each of at least some of the platform applications;  

   obtain performance information associated with an allocated wireless link;  

   provide, to a platform application allocated to the allocated wireless link, an indication of the performance information; and  

   cause the platform application to dynamically modify application data generated by the platform application based on the indication of the performance information before transmission of the application data over the allocated wireless link.

2. **A method of communication by a mobile platform comprising an aircraft, a vessel, or a vehicle, the method comprising:**  

   allocating, by one or more processors of the mobile platform, respective wireless links among a plurality of platform applications;  

   obtaining performance information for a wireless link allocated to a platform application of the plurality of platform applications;  

   communicating an indication of the performance information to the platform application;  

   dynamically modifying, by the platform application, application data based on the indication of the performance information; and  

   transmitting the modified application data over the wireless link allocated to the platform application.
